{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52390","headline":"回波乐 三十三 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 三十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可笑世间人，爲言恒不死。\n贪□（原作「懦」，抹去，旁改字漫漶，陈补「恡」字）不知休，相憎不解止。\n背地道他非，对面伊不是。\n埋着黄蒿中，犹成薄媚鬼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52390.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52390","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}